      {
        "speakerId": "c-02",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 290962,
            "end": 305272,
            "text": "Staff who move departments still show up with their prior access weeks later because the provisioning sync does not pick up the role change."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "c-02",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 314812,
            "end": 329121,
            "text": "One of our regional coordinators moved roles in July and kept her prior permissions for almost six weeks before IT caught it."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "2002",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 343431,
            "end": 372050,
            "text": "Appreciate the detail, let me ask a quick follow up."
          },
          {
            "start": 372051,
            "end": 376820,
            "text": "How long did it take before anyone noticed the access had not updated?"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "c-02",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 381590,
            "end": 410209,
            "text": "Close to six weeks, until she tried to approve something she should not have had access to."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "2002",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 424519,
            "end": 429289,
            "text": "That covers the main item, what else has been happening on your side?"
